summary:
  A watch that was never armed gives a verdict.

history:
  An Ogg FLAC stream taken straight off the socket stands at 278 ms from
  its first second while the player says it plays, and the relay's rescue
  takes it six seconds in. A position has to be seen three seconds further
  on before its standing says anything; without that, every start whose
  output takes no sound would be opened again and again.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandLogic.js

find:
      if (m.armed && full === true && nowMs

replace:
      if (full === true && nowMs

expect:
  Killed by tst_standlogic::test_a_position_never_seen_to_move_is_no_witness.
  Line-neutral.
